Z||000000||tinuvin||07-02-2001||12:29 PM||||I JUST PURCHASED A 1984 INDY FIERO. I DID NOT GET AN OWNERS MANUAL WITH IT. (HAVE ORDERED ONE). CAN ANYONE GIVE ME THE LAYOUT OF THE FUSE BOX,(WHAT FUSE IS FOR WHAT, AND WHERE?)  I GUESS I WILL BE VISITING THIS SITE A LOT FROM NOW ON. THIS IS MY FIRST FIERO. I LOVE IT.<BR>THANKS||||reg||5
Z||000001||Leadfoot||07-02-2001||01:14 PM||||Welcome! Just a suggestion...use lower case letters.  People here take upper case to be representive of yelling.  As for the fuse box layout pep boys or super track have manuals which contain such information.  Just stop over there and take a quick peek until you get your service manual in.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierohoho||07-02-2001||11:08 PM||||tinuvin, welcome, if you go to get a repair book, get a Haynes, I have found it's a little better than the Chilton. <P>Her's a list of the fuse block, when its pulled down/swung out the spare fuse holder will be on the bottom so I'll start at the upper left with #1 and go left to right and down the 5 rows.<BR>#1 10amp ECM (computer)<BR>#2 10amp (fuel pump,oil pressure switch)<BR>#3 20amp (brake lights, hazard, chime)<BR>#4 20amp (coolant fan)<BR>#5 20amp (turn signal,reverse lights)<BR>#6 Empty<BR>#7 20amp (parking lights)<BR>#8 20amp (heater a/c)<BR>#9 20amp (volt meter,cruise,speedo,a/c relay,<BR>          torque converter clutch,brake<BR>          switch,rear deck lid)<BR>#10 Empty<BR>#11 20amp (dome light,horn,clock,lighter,<BR>           power locks,power mirrors)<BR>#12 30amp(this is a circuit breaker)<BR>#13 5amp (inst. panel lights,headlamp<BR>          warning)<BR>#14 10amp(radio,cruise)<BR>#15 30amp(this is a circuit breaker,power <BR>          locks,rear defog)<BR>#16 20amp(windshield wiper)<BR>#17 3amp (crank signal to ECM)<BR>that should cover all the fuse spots that have two contacts. Hope that helps.<P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l||||reg||1
Z||000003||tinuvin||07-02-2001||11:21 PM||||thanks for the information, guys. that will help a lot. it is nice to be able to have so much helpful information. thanks again||||reg||6
